; Handwritten R2018 fixtures for #382 (ADR 0011 and ADR 0020).
; tabelle.dxf omits ENDTAB after STYLE and LTYPE, before LAYER.
; Group 5 gives DASHED handle 17 and layer 0 handle 10 (hexadecimal).
; DASHED groups 49 are 12.0 and -3.0; group 40 is abs(12)+abs(-3)=15.
; Layer 0 has color 7 (62) and linetype DASHED (6); ENTITIES is empty.
; Reports expose properties, not table handles. Check them before and after
; saving and reopening; do not require byte identity for malformed tables.
OPEN
tabelle.dxf
!report
SAVEAS
tabelle-riaperte.dxf
OPEN
tabelle-riaperte.dxf
!report
; style-layer.dxf isolates STYLE without ENDTAB immediately before LAYER.
; No LTYPE table: layer 0 uses the mandatory Continuous linetype.
OPEN
style-layer.dxf
!report
SAVEAS
style-layer-riaperto.dxf
OPEN
style-layer-riaperto.dxf
